Output docs/comp/final-defense-media/videos/p10-qemu-port.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1600
Set Height 900
Set FontSize 22
Set LetterSpacing 0
Set LineHeight 1.05
Set Padding 36
Set Theme "Catppuccin Latte"
Set Framerate 30
Set TypingSpeed 4ms
Type "cd docs/comp/final-defense-media"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+L
Type "sed -n '1,24p' transcripts/p10-qemu-port.txt"
Enter
Sleep 17s
